#: examples.md:1
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "例"

#: examples.md:3
msgid ""
"All the example are run within the same environment of the installation "
"procedure"
msgstr "すべての例は、インストール手順と同じ環境で実行する。"

#: examples.md:7
msgid "Things to know:"
msgstr "知っておくこと："

#: examples.md:8
msgid ""
"I am always using \"path/to\" for indication the directory that contain a "
"file"
msgstr "ファイルを含むディレクトリを示すため、常に path/to という表記を使う。"

#: examples.md:9
msgid ""
"Python will communicate with plumed using a module called "
"\"plumedCommunications\" that is embedded with `PythonCVInterface.so`"
msgstr ""
"Python は、`PythonCVInterface.so` に組み込まれた plumedCommunications という Module で "
"PLUMED と通信する。"

#: examples.md:10
msgid ""
"The string `path/to/PythonCVInterface.so` can be obtained by running `python"
" -m pycv`"
msgstr "`path/to/PythonCVInterface.so` は、`python -m pycv` を実行して取得できる。"

#: examples.md:11
msgid ""
"The string `path/to/PythonCVInterface.so` can be obtained within a python "
"script with"
msgstr "Python スクリプト内では、次の方法で `path/to/PythonCVInterface.so` を取得できる。"

#: examples.md:17
msgid "Getting the manual"
msgstr "マニュアルの取得"

#: examples.md:19
msgid "This is a bonus, but can be helpful:"
msgstr "補足だが、次の機能も便利である。"

# Literal notation or identifier intentionally preserved.
#: examples.md:21 examples.md:77 examples.md:110 examples.md:145
msgid "plumed.dat"
msgstr "plumed.dat"

# Literal notation or identifier intentionally preserved.
#: examples.md:28
msgid "pyhelp.py"
msgstr "pyhelp.py"

#: examples.md:51
msgid "Then run with `plumed driver --plumed plumed.dat --ixyz traj.xyz`"
msgstr "次に、`plumed driver --plumed plumed.dat --ixyz traj.xyz` で実行する。"

#: examples.md:54
msgid ""
"This thing will not have any results on the trajectory, but you will get the"
" manual of the interface in a few txt files."
msgstr "この処理は Trajectory に影響を与えないが、Interface のマニュアルをいくつかの txt ファイルとして得られる。"

#: examples.md:56
msgid "Or alternatively you can run:"
msgstr "別の方法として、次も実行できる。"

# Literal notation or identifier intentionally preserved.
#: examples.md:57
msgid "pyhelp_html.py"
msgstr "pyhelp_html.py"

#: examples.md:70
msgid ""
"To get an extreme bare-bones HTML documentation, that you can browse by "
"running `python -m http.server` and then going to the address that appears "
"on the terminal, that usually is 0.0.0.0:8000, with your internet browser."
msgstr ""
"ごく簡素な HTML ドキュメントが得られる。`python -m http.server` を実行し、Terminal に表示されるアドレス、通常は "
"0.0.0.0:8000 をウェブブラウザで開くと閲覧できる。"

#: examples.md:73
msgid "Distance (with PBC)"
msgstr "Distance（PBC を考慮）"

#: examples.md:75
msgid "In this example we show how to use the PBCs in a calculation:"
msgstr "この例では、計算で PBCs を使う方法を示す。"

# Literal notation or identifier intentionally preserved.
#: examples.md:87
msgid "pydistancePBCs.py"
msgstr "pydistancePBCs.py"

#: examples.md:105
msgid ""
"Here we are getting the pbc calculator from plumed and \"patching\" the "
"distances with it by using the method `apply` like in C++ plumed, but on a "
"`list/np.ndarray` that must be shaped `[nat,3]`"
msgstr ""
"PLUMED から PBC Calculator を取得し、C++ の PLUMED と同じように `apply` "
"を使って距離を補正する。ただし、対象は `[nat,3]` の形を持つ `list/np.ndarray` である。"

#: examples.md:107
msgid "Periodicity"
msgstr "Periodicity"

#: examples.md:109
msgid ""
"This is just an example on how the user can work with the periodicity of the"
" retuned variables"
msgstr "返す変数の Periodicity を扱う方法を示す例である。"

# Literal notation or identifier intentionally preserved.
